{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29119","headline":"郡斋夜坐寄旧乡二侄 · 许浑","name":"郡斋夜坐寄旧乡二侄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千官奉职衮龙垂，旅卧淮阳鬓日衰。\n三月已乖棠树政，二年空负竹林期。\n楼侵白浪风来远，城抱丹岩日到迟。\n长欲挂帆君莫笑，越禽花晚梦南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}